                                "text": "tangled knot"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bf2e2d9-cf17-4154-bea8-910889167ac1",
                                "sense_id": "856371c8-8241-30cc-9ab1-d250629883e0",
                                "text": "Troubled, 'wilder'd, and forlorn, / Dark, benighted, travel-worn, / Over many a tangled spray, / All heart-broke I heard her say"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "586bc3d2-d5b7-4330-a4e9-da3dcfaf9ab4",
                                "sense_id": "856371c8-8241-30cc-9ab1-d250629883e0",
                                "text": "That like a mighty river onward streams / In multitudinous channels ruthlessly, / Past tangled isles and barriers of sand"
                            }
                        ]
